## Day to day: the management tunnel first

All admin access goes through the WireGuard tunnel `homelab-mgmt` (Windows) / `wg-mgmt` (WSL).

| Host | Tunnel address | SSH |
|---|---|---|
| Server 1 (Moscow) | 10.99.0.11 | `ssh vps1` (= `ops@10.99.0.11`, key `~/.ssh/id_ed25519`) |
| Server 2 (Lithuania) | 10.99.0.12 | `ssh vps2` (= `ops@10.99.0.12`) |
| staging VM | 10.99.0.21 / {{ staging_ip }} | `ssh ops@{{ staging_ip }}` (LAN) |
| home PC (WSL control node) | 10.99.0.1 | - |
| home PC (Windows) | 10.99.0.2 | - |

